1.2 Selectively disabling features
==================================

All three features are enabled by default.  Each can be turned off
independently before enabling the mode:

     ;; Disable the faster node display function (keep org-roam's default template)
     (setq org-roam-gt-enable-node-display-function nil)

     ;; Disable the extended capture targets
     (setq org-roam-gt-enable-capture-targets nil)

     (org-roam-gt-mode 1)

   If the mode is already running, disable it, change the variable, then
re-enable:

     (org-roam-gt-mode -1)
     (setq org-roam-gt-enable-node-display-function nil)
     (org-roam-gt-mode 1)

